# TC001 - Add Product to Cart Successfully

## Test Scenario
Add a product to the shopping cart successfully


## Objective
Validate that the user can successfully add a product to the cart and that the selected item is displayed correctly with accurate information (name, price, and quantity).


## Preconditions
User is on the products page.

URL: https://automationexercise.com/products


## Test Steps
1. Navigate to the Products page
2. Select a product from the list
3. Click on "ADD TO CART"
4. Click on "View Cart"


## Expected Result
The product should be displayed in the cart with correct details:
- Product name
- Price
- Quantity


## Actual Result
The product was successfully added to the cart and displayed correctly with name, price, and quantity.


## Status
Passed 


